  .gitignore      .repos/*/*/*/ (the checkouts) and .env, added to one that lacks them
No page, no AGENTS.md: those belong to a template. No git init. A <dir> inside another root
is refused unless it is a checkout, <root>/.repos/<host>/<owner>/<repo>. Then the layers .ken
lists, and theirs, are cloned at the top when missing and linked: the layers of each inside it,
owner AGENTS.md from each and skills from the direct ones where the root has none.'
